LanguageData.BM_LevelTooltip:
Only colonists whose construction level is within {0}~{1} and who have the matching build permission will automatically build {2}.
Right-click forced construction is unrestricted. 0~20 = no limit.

Eligible colonists: {3}

LanguageData.BM_WindowHint:
Permissions, level ranges and build order live on this tab:
· the table lists unbuilt type groups; drag the ≡ handle to reorder;
· click a row name to see its details and set its construction level range on the right;
· lack, en-route and grant state are shown inline; see Diagnostics for details.

The search box at the top right filters by name; the Diagnostics tab explains why an order is stuck.
